# Local knowledge base

An MCP server named `kb` exposes `search` / `read` / `status` / `skills`.

Call `search` when the question is about past decisions, runbooks, environment
facts, or project history. One call, not per turn. Expand a hit with `read`
before quoting — the snippet is 240 characters, not the page. Cite `path:line`.
